From 8ac074bd74677c6ae341a0f376c62d21f96f6d3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] virtual pool: support low-difficulty interoperability

Why: support the low-difficulty interoperability required by the Bitronics and
Nerdminers release gate. PublicPool remains an optional interoperability target.
Virtual-only: subscribe-agent overrides, submit-response recovery, and timing
adjustments are scoped to CONFIG_BITAXE_VIRTUAL; pool settings remain
ESP-Miner-compatible API fields.
Upstream surface: Stratum API/task behavior, NVS pool settings, HTTP system info,
ASIC result handling, scoreboard formatting, and AxeOS difficulty display.
Verify: run make verify-submit-replay and make verify-release.
Removal impact: required low-difficulty pool phases can fail accepted-share
evidence or report low-difficulty settings incorrectly.

